{:edb/committed true :edb/basis-t 1922 :edb/replayed false :edb/tx-hash "ae6721b13d761ddc06e667536f1c60c764230ff267b05eb752727921cdbb6518" :edb/db-before-t 1921 :edb/db-after-t 1922 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535234 50 #inst "2026-10-08T20:08:14.379Z" 13194139535234 true] [17592186124421 1020 #edb/ref 17592186338991 13194139535234 true] [17592186124421 1020 #edb/ref 17592186338998 13194139535234 true] [17592186124476 1020 #edb/ref 17592186338984 13194139535234 true] [17592186124476 1020 #edb/ref 17592186339005 13194139535234 true] [17592186124904 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535234 true] [17592186124904 1100 "Given the hyperboloid of one sheet $(x - 2)^{2} + \\frac{y^{2}}{4} - \\frac{z^{2}}{9} = 1$, find the domain of $z = z(x, y)$." 13194139535234 false] [17592186124904 1100 "Given the hyperboloid of one sheet $(x-2)^{2}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4}-\\frac{{z}^{2}}{9}=1$, find the domain of $z=z(x,y).$" 13194139535234 true] [17592186124904 1145 "From the hyperboloid equation, we make $z$ the subject as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x-2)^{2}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4}-\\frac{{z}^{2}}{9} & =1 \\\\ (x-2)^{2}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4}-1 & =\\frac{{z}^{2}}{9}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{z}^{2} & =9((x-2)^{2}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4}-1) \\\\ z & =\\pm 3\\sqrt{(x-2)^{2}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4}-1}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince the square root is defined only for non-negative arguments, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x-2)^{2}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4}-1 & \\ge 0 \\\\ (x-2)^{2}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4} & \\ge 1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich gives the exterior of the ellipse $(x-2)^{2}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4}=1,$ which includes the boundary.\n\nTherefore, the domain is\n\n$$\n{(x,y)\\,:\\,(x-2)^{2}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4}\\ge 1}.\n$$" 13194139535234 true] [17592186338984 1017 #edb/ref 17592186338985 13194139535234 true] [17592186338984 1089 "q-36288" 13194139535234 true] [17592186338984 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535234 true] [17592186338984 1100 "What is the projection of the intersection between the hyperboloid of two sheets $\\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{2}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4}-\\frac{{z}^{2}}{8}=-1$ and the plane $y=2$ onto the $xz$-plane?" 13194139535234 true] [17592186338984 1113 #uuid "fcfedd1b-1d6b-51cf-8ffc-3860006da14a" 13194139535234 true] [17592186338984 1145 "To find the intersection of the hyperboloid and the plane $y=2$, we substitute $y=2$ into the equation of the hyperboloid:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{2}+\\frac{(2)^{2}}{4}-\\frac{{z}^{2}}{8} & =-1 \\\\ \\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{2}+1-\\frac{{z}^{2}}{8} & =-1 \\\\ \\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{2}-\\frac{{z}^{2}}{8} & =-2 \\\\ -\\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{4}+\\frac{{z}^{2}}{16} & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we get the hyperbola: $-\\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{4}+\\frac{{z}^{2}}{16}=1.$" 13194139535234 true] [17592186338985 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338986 13194139535234 true] [17592186338985 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338987 13194139535234 true] [17592186338985 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338988 13194139535234 true] [17592186338985 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338989 13194139535234 true] [17592186338985 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338990 13194139535234 true] [17592186338985 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535234 true] [17592186338985 1041 "selection" 13194139535234 true] [17592186338985 1104 #edb/ref 17592186338987 13194139535234 true] [17592186338985 1110 #uuid "bc0ff648-0b9b-5d68-8989-082d8d1ac7e7" 13194139535234 true] [17592186338986 1034 "A hyperbola: $\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4}-\\frac{{z}^{2}}{8}=-1$" 13194139535234 true] [17592186338986 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535234 true] [17592186338986 1111 #uuid "17022fb1-5112-5533-b749-04a65ab35462" 13194139535234 true] [17592186338987 1034 "A hyperbola: $-\\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{4}+\\frac{{z}^{2}}{16}=1$" 13194139535234 true] [17592186338987 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535234 true] [17592186338987 1111 #uuid "35224d72-9991-5312-8440-3ce5a67e73db" 13194139535234 true] [17592186338988 1034 "A hyperbola: $\\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{2}-\\frac{{z}^{2}}{8}=1$" 13194139535234 true] [17592186338988 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535234 true] [17592186338988 1111 #uuid "e07785da-bacd-5924-8019-b3061461d6f6" 13194139535234 true] [17592186338989 1034 "Two parallel lines: $z=2x\\pm 4$" 13194139535234 true] [17592186338989 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535234 true] [17592186338989 1111 #uuid "e13efd66-9868-589e-8498-1c76c8371f95" 13194139535234 true] [17592186338990 1034 "An ellipse: $\\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{2}+\\frac{{z}^{2}}{8}=1$" 13194139535234 true] [17592186338990 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535234 true] [17592186338990 1111 #uuid "03f0c68d-996e-5d85-bc53-4c76a24ac8ca" 13194139535234 true] [17592186338991 1017 #edb/ref 17592186338992 13194139535234 true] [17592186338991 1089 "q-36388" 13194139535234 true] [17592186338991 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535234 true] [17592186338991 1100 "Given the hyperboloid of one sheet  $\\frac{{x}^{2}}{6}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{2}-\\frac{(z+1)^{2}}{3}=1$, find the domain of $z=z(x,y).$" 13194139535234 true] [17592186338991 1113 #uuid "a512bde0-1c66-51f2-af4c-d779890eea15" 13194139535234 true] [17592186338991 1145 "From the hyperboloid equation, we make $z$ the subject as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{x}^{2}}{6}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{2}-\\frac{(z+1)^{2}}{3} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{{x}^{2}}{6}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{2}-1 & =\\frac{(z+1)^{2}}{3} \\\\ (z+1)^{2} & =3(\\frac{{x}^{2}}{6}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{2}-1) \\\\ (z+1) & =\\pm \\sqrt{3(\\frac{{x}^{2}}{6}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{2}-1)}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nSince the square root is defined only for non-negative arguments, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{x}^{2}}{6}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{2}-1 & \\ge 0 \\\\ \\frac{{x}^{2}}{6}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{2} & \\ge 1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich gives the exterior of the ellipse $\\frac{{x}^{2}}{6}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{2}=1$, including its boundary.\n\nTherefore, the domain is\n\n$$\n{(x,y)\\,:\\,\\frac{{x}^{2}}{6}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{2}\\ge 1}.\n$$" 13194139535234 true] [17592186338992 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338993 13194139535234 true] [17592186338992 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338994 13194139535234 true] [17592186338992 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338995 13194139535234 true] [17592186338992 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338996 13194139535234 true] [17592186338992 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338997 13194139535234 true] [17592186338992 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535234 true] [17592186338992 1041 "selection" 13194139535234 true] [17592186338992 1104 #edb/ref 17592186338997 13194139535234 true] [17592186338992 1110 #uuid "f7af6c87-f1c4-563d-815c-c1b791f2019a" 13194139535234 true] [17592186338993 1034 "{(x,y)\\,:\\,\\frac{{x}^{2}}{6}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{2}<1}" 13194139535234 true] [17592186338993 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535234 true] [17592186338993 1111 #uuid "8691b817-07e3-5444-963c-feb3658f53ba" 13194139535234 true] [17592186338994 1034 "The entire $xy$-plane" 13194139535234 true] [17592186338994 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535234 true] [17592186338994 1111 #uuid "37038554-0809-5cbd-b086-1402bddf9a27" 13194139535234 true] [17592186338995 1034 "{(x,y)\\,:\\,\\frac{{x}^{2}}{6}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{2}\\ge 0}" 13194139535234 true] [17592186338995 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535234 true] [17592186338995 1111 #uuid "30303328-08ed-5e01-ad90-cc263ebd3f1e" 13194139535234 true] [17592186338996 1034 "{(x,y)\\,:\\,\\frac{{x}^{2}}{6}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{2}<0}" 13194139535234 true] [17592186338996 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535234 true] [17592186338996 1111 #uuid "2e96d36e-9083-5c65-a480-de9f7f1c813c" 13194139535234 true] [17592186338997 1034 "{(x,y)\\,:\\,\\frac{{x}^{2}}{6}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{2}\\ge 1}" 13194139535234 true] [17592186338997 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535234 true] [17592186338997 1111 #uuid "b2c0d0cc-0db3-547e-adfa-51a99a2e3514" 13194139535234 true] [17592186338998 1017 #edb/ref 17592186338999 13194139535234 true] [17592186338998 1089 "q-71859" 13194139535234 true] [17592186338998 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535234 true] [17592186338998 1100 "Given the hyperboloid of one sheet  $\\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{8}-\\frac{(z-1)^{2}}{5}=1$, find the domain of $z=z(x,y).$" 13194139535234 true] [17592186338998 1113 #uuid "73e903d1-edee-53d5-8ed7-40e859ad5358" 13194139535234 true] [17592186338998 1145 "From the hyperboloid equation, we make $z$ the subject as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{8}-\\frac{(z-1)^{2}}{5} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{8}-1 & =\\frac{(z-1)^{2}}{5} \\\\ (z-1)^{2} & =5(\\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{8}-1) \\\\ (z-1) & =\\pm \\sqrt{5(\\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{8}-1)}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n  \n\nSince the square root is defined only for non-negative arguments, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{8}-1 & \\ge 0 \\\\ \\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{8} & \\ge 1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich gives the exterior of the ellipse $\\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{8}=1$, including its boundary.\n\nTherefore, the domain is\n\n$$\n{(x,y)\\,:\\,\\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{8}\\ge 1}.\n$$" 13194139535234 true] [17592186338999 1000 #edb/ref 17592186339000 13194139535234 true] [17592186338999 1000 #edb/ref 17592186339001 13194139535234 true] [17592186338999 1000 #edb/ref 17592186339002 13194139535234 true] [17592186338999 1000 #edb/ref 17592186339003 13194139535234 true] [17592186338999 1000 #edb/ref 17592186339004 13194139535234 true] [17592186338999 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535234 true] [17592186338999 1041 "selection" 13194139535234 true] [17592186338999 1104 #edb/ref 17592186339003 13194139535234 true] [17592186338999 1110 #uuid "11eb0e8f-a65c-581e-badb-321a66b262d2" 13194139535234 true] [17592186339000 1034 "{(x,y)\\,:\\,\\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}-\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{8}>0}" 13194139535234 true] [17592186339000 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535234 true] [17592186339000 1111 #uuid "c191664c-91e5-544b-a9e5-6fdfe461401f" 13194139535234 true] [17592186339001 1034 "{(x,y)\\,:\\,\\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{8}<1}" 13194139535234 true] [17592186339001 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535234 true] [17592186339001 1111 #uuid "b4d98915-83c5-59e4-be75-f686b94c8be4" 13194139535234 true] [17592186339002 1034 "{(x,y)\\,:\\,\\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}-\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{8}<0}" 13194139535234 true] [17592186339002 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535234 true] [17592186339002 1111 #uuid "1ac83b4a-6053-5c4c-9a91-3703a3df9d97" 13194139535234 true] [17592186339003 1034 "{(x,y)\\,:\\,\\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{8}\\ge 1}" 13194139535234 true] [17592186339003 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535234 true] [17592186339003 1111 #uuid "28cddf47-44dd-57e1-822b-eda59ead2fca" 13194139535234 true] [17592186339004 1034 "{(x,y)\\,:\\,\\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{8}\\le 1}" 13194139535234 true] [17592186339004 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535234 true] [17592186339004 1111 #uuid "62875bf8-d496-51b2-8e61-1e96fcce1e92" 13194139535234 true] [17592186339005 1017 #edb/ref 17592186339006 13194139535234 true] [17592186339005 1089 "q-71957" 13194139535234 true] [17592186339005 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139535234 true] [17592186339005 1100 "What is the trace in the $xy$-plane of the hyperboloid of one sheet $\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4}+\\frac{{z}^{2}}{6}=1?$" 13194139535234 true] [17592186339005 1113 #uuid "d349238c-6c2f-5255-bd28-dab6727e3a56" 13194139535234 true] [17592186339005 1145 "To find the trace in the $xy$-plane, we substitute $z=0$ into the equation of the hyperboloid:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4}+\\frac{{0}^{2}}{6}=1 \\\\ \\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4}=1 \\\\ 2{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}=4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis gives us the equation of a hyperbola in $xy$-plane." 13194139535234 true] [17592186339006 1000 #edb/ref 17592186339007 13194139535234 true] [17592186339006 1000 #edb/ref 17592186339008 13194139535234 true] [17592186339006 1000 #edb/ref 17592186339009 13194139535234 true] [17592186339006 1000 #edb/ref 17592186339010 13194139535234 true] [17592186339006